# Media policy per fellows/README.md, rule of 2026-09-18 (Bear):
# renders go to Drive, build inputs stay here. Excluded by LOCATION, not type.
#
# OUT - produced by the pipeline from the beat sheet:
mp3/
audio/
media/
clips/
renders/
mp4/
exports/
_qc/
_work/

# IN, deliberately NOT ignored, because git will not descend into an excluded
# directory and a file left in one is dropped without warning:
#   timings.json          the measured narration clock every beat was conformed
#                         to. Kept at this folder's root rather than mp3/.
#   qc-sheet-16x9*.png    the settled-frame contact sheets. Kept here rather
#                         than _qc/, which is an excluded location.
#   beat-sheet-short.json the 9:16 cut's own beat sheet. The portrait cut is a
#                         native render at portrait dimensions, not a centre
#                         cut, so this sheet is the build input - there is no
#                         pantry/ of portrait overrides to commit.

.venv/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
